# "... is a Toy artifact creature ... in addition to its other types" (CR 205.1b, 613.1d) makes it a creature for as long as
# the Aura is on it, not only while something else does: on turn 3 Bot1's Llanowar Elves crews Smuggler's Copter, an
# artifact creature until end of turn, and Unable to Scream goes on it. On turn 5 the crew effect is long over, and the Copter
# is still a 0/2 Toy artifact creature - so still a creature the Aura may enchant (CR 303.4d) - its crew ability gone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Smuggler's Copter
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Unable to Scream
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Smuggler's Copter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Types = Artifact
Bot1.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Activate(Ability: Crew)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Unable to Scream.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Activate(Ability: Crew)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Unable to Scream.AttachedTo = Smuggler's Copter
Bot1.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Types = Artifact; Creature
Bot1.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Subtypes = Toy; Vehicle
Bot1.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Power = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Toughness = 2
